    "WAIVER",
    "W"
   ],
   "permitted": [
    "WAIVER",
    "W"
   ],
   "why": "Cory: 'Each player has their own projected ceiling and it could be irrelevant to another player at same age and position.' WAIVER is a property of the league leftovers and W of the roster; neither is a property of a player. Anything else touching a band is the defect."
  },
  "C2_known_positive_ceiling_can_move_a_pick": {
   "ok": true,
