   "why": "a planted +150 ceiling must be worth NOTHING at LEAN=0 and a lot at LEAN=1 in a bench slot. If it cannot move here, a null result on ceilings anywhere else means nothing (rule 3e)."
  },
  "C5_known_positive_injury_can_move_a_pick": {
   "ok": true,
